      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "34",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana ase Zedekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia, ekero Nebukadinesaro, omorwoti o Babiloni, amo nabarwani baye bonsi b’esegi, na amarwoti onsi ayarenge inse y’obogambi bwaye, na abanto bonsi barenge korwania Yerusalemu na emechie yaye, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Genda okwane na Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, omoteebie ng’a aya naro inche Omonene ngoteeba: Rora, nkobeeka inde omochie oyo ase okoboko kw’omorwoti o Babiloni. Omorwoti oyio nayosambe nomorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye togotooreka korwa ase okoboko kwaye. Goika obwatwe na kobekwa ase okoboko kwaye, erinde mororane nomorwoti o Babiloni, amaiso ase amaiso, na gokwana nere morigereranetie obosio ase obosio, aye goika oirwe Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene, ekiagera aya nar’Omonene agoteeba igoro yao: Aye togoitwa n’omoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nigo orakwe kore nomorembe, na buna abanto basambete ebinsari bigotioka buya ase ogotindekwa gwe chisokoro chiao, na abarwoti abwo bagotang’anerete, naboigo abanto barasambe ebinsari ase ogotindeka, na bakoreere aye, bagoteeba; Obee, Omonene! Nab’Omonene atebiire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeremia omobani agateebia Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda amang’ana ayio onsi agwo Yerusalemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekero abasikari b’omorwoti o Babiloni bagendererete korwania Yerusalemu na emechie ya Lakisi na Aseka, emechie y’Abayuda, konya yatigaire yagiteire chindwaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okong’anererigwa kw’abasomba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Yeremia magega Zedekia omorwoti gakoorire gokora okobwatana nabaanto bonsi ba Yerusalemu ng’a obosibore borarigwe ase egati yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omonto asibore abasomba baye Abaiberania, abasacha na abakungu, erinde monto onde tabaisa gokora Omoyahudi, omonto omwabo, abe omosomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaanene b’oborwoti amo nabaanto bonsi abakorete okobwatana ng’a kera omonto asibore omosomba oye, omosacha gose omokungu, bakaigwa amang’ana ayio na bakabasibora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende magega y’ayio abanto nigo baonchorete ebirengererio biabo, bakairania abasomba babo, abasacha na abakungu, abwo konya basiboirwe, na bakababetereria koba abasomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana eri ri’Omonene eriachete ase Yeremia rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Nigo nakorete okobwatana kw’ogotianania ne chisokoro chiaino ekero nachirusetie korwa ase ense ya Misiri, nkabasibora korwa ase ense eria y’obosomba, nkabateebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omoerio bw’omwaka o gatano na kabere kera oyomo oino asibore Omoiberania, omonto omwabo, oyoonetigwe asare na obeire okomokorera ase engaki y’emiaka etano nomo; ere goika aegwe obosibore. Korende chisokoro chiaino tichianyigwerete gose gotegerera chiigwe amang’ana aane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reero iga mweitia mogakora amang’ana are amaronge ase amaiso aane, mokararia obosibore, kera omonto ase omogisangio oye. Boigo mogakora okobwatana kw’ogotianania ase obosio bwane, agwo ase enyomba eyio ekorokwa ase erieta riane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio mokaonchora ebirengererio biaino, mogakora erieta riane rikaba eritachenegeti, ekiagera kera oyomo oino nigo airania abasomba baye, abasacha na abakungu, abwo konya mwasiboire buna barabwo baganetie. Na bono mwabarentire na kobabetereria koba abasomba baino naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Inwe mwangire konyigwera, na koraria obosibore kera omonto ase oyomwabo, na ase omogisangio oye. Rora inche nkobaa nde inwe obosibore bwaino; obosibore obwo nabwo obo: Nigo moraitwe nemioro, na oborwaire bogoita, na enchara. Na amarwoti onsi ay’ense naondoke ase engencho y’amang’ana ayio ndabakorere inwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo basaretie okobwatana kw’ogotianania nakorete nabarabwo, gose tibarendete amang’ana ’okobwatana koria barabwo bakorete ase obosio bwane, inche nimbakorere buna barabwo bakorete ase emori eria y’okobwatana, bayenachanete ebing’ese bibere, erio bagaeta ase egati y’ebing’ese biria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo amo nabanene b’oborwoti bw’Abayuda, na aba Yerusalemu, na abateneneri b’enyomba y’omorwoti, na abakuani, na abanto bonsi b’ense eye, baria baetete ase egati y’ebing’ese bi’emori eria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimbabeeke ase amaboko ’ababisa babo na ase amaboko ’abaanto bakorigia gosiria obogima bwabo. Nabaitwe bakwe, na emebere yabo ebe endagera ye chinyoni ne ching’iti chi’orosana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Zedekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, amo nabanene b’oborwoti bwaye, nimbabeeke ase amaboko ’ababisa babo, na ase amaboko ’abaanto bakorigia gosiria obogima bwabo. Nimbabeeke ase amaboko ’abarwani b’omorwoti o Babiloni abwo konya baabatigire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Omonene nigo ngoteeba iga: “Naama! Ninchike abanto abwo bairane ase omochie oyo. Nabayorwanie na koyobwata, naende bayosambe nomorero. Ninsarie emechie y’Abayuda ebe bosa temenywa nonde.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
